.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd November 1, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-SELFTEST 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-selftest
.Nd run the known-answer self-test of noqtis
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis selftest
runs
.Xr nqselftest 3 :
fixed inputs through every algorithm family (SHA-2, SHA-3, SHAKE and
KangarooTwelve, HMAC, ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA key generation, HQC,
Ed25519 and a hybrid, BLAKE2b, HKDF, PBKDF2, Argon2id, AES-GCM,
ChaCha20-Poly1305, ChaCha20, AES-SIV, AES-GCM-SIV and X25519), each
family\(aqs outputs compared by their SHA-256 with the known
answers built into the library.
It prints
.Dl selftest: every known answer matches
or
.Dl selftest: a known answer did not match
without naming the family, and takes about a tenth of a second.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 when every known answer matches, 1 when one does not, 2 on a usage
error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr nqselftest 3
